algorithms.pseudocode:
Input: Set function W: 2^[n] → Q (over finite ground set [n])
Output: Boolean (true iff W is submodular)

for each A in Powerset([n]):
    for each B in Powerset([n]):
        if W(A) + W(B) < W(A ∩ B) + W(A ∪ B):
            return false
return true

Complexity: O(4^n) time, O(2^n) space
